{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-08-02 15:00:00', 'title': 'AEP COMPLETES SALE OF CARDINAL PLANT UNIT 1', 'text': "COLUMBUS, OHIO , AUG. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) HAS COMPLETED THE SALE OF THE 595-MEGAWATT (MW) CARDINAL PLANT UNIT 1 IN BRILLIANT, OHIO, FROM AEP GENERATION RESOURCES, THE COMPANY'S COMPETITIVE GENERATION AFFILIATE, TO BUCKEYE POWER. IN MARCH, AEP REACHED AN AGREEMENT TO SELL CARDINAL PLANT UNIT 1 AND THE COMPANY'S OWNERSHIP STAKE IN CARDINAL OPERATING COMPANY TO BUCKEYE POWER."}{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2022-08-02 10:00:00', 'title': 'AEP NAMES HAWKINS VICE PRESIDENT OF FINANCE & TREASURY', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, OHIO , AUG. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER (NASDAQ: AEP) HAS NAMED RENEE V. HAWKINS VICE PRESIDENT – FINANCE & TREASURY, EFFECTIVE AUG. 6.'}